12-10-94   Online FootBall ver 2.0

 This is Online FootBall version 2.0 written by
Matt English! Now has direct support for BBBBS, DLG,
Trinity, TransAmiga, CNET, E!, 4D BBS and should run
on ANY Amiga BBS !!
 This is a FULL featured FootBall simulation that can be
played over many BBS's and also can be played in a shell!
 Many new features, including "The OLFB Sysop Challenge".
The Sysop Challenge allows the Player to Challenge the
BBS sysop to a head to head, one on one, live, real time
game of Online FootBall! Many new features and enhanced
original features!

 Complete Documentation in Amiga Guide format.

                 Check it out!
